<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 400 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 400 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 400 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>			    EARLY	1100 GMT   1300 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    900 MLN    900 MLN    900 MLN    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    =	    400 MLN*   800 MLN*   =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p> BAND 1  T-BILLS	=	     31 MLN*   192 MLN*   =</p>
<p> BAND 1  BANK BILLS   =	    369 MLN*   208 MLN*   =</p>
<p>* INTEREST RATE - 5-11/16 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
